OL,3,GNEWSAFour men arrested in extreme      
OL,4,Aright-wing terrorism investigation     
OL,6,FFour men have been arrested as part of 
OL,7,Fa police investigation into extreme    
OL,8,Fright-wing terrorism.                  
OL,10,FThe men, all in their 30s, were        
OL,11,Fdetained under the Terrorism Act on    
OL,12,FThursday.                              
OL,14,FThe arrests were made in the Balloo    
OL,15,Farea of Bangor, the Mount area of east 
OL,16,FBelfast and the Donegall Pass area of  
OL,17,Fsouth Belfast.                         
OL,19,FAll four were taken to Musgrave Serious
OL,20,FCrime Suite for questioning.           
